{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.toru.star",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "傍晚的公园，她仰着头",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.toru.star",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.toru.star",
    "idolId": "toru",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "有颗星星在亮。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——啊……真的。是什么星呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，透——",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "走吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "傍晚要结束了。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……——哈哈。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好……！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "呼……好棒的傍晚……！——嗯——……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "呼，别突然伸懒腰啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是，可是在这么好的景色前面——嗯——……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "嗯……——",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "感觉全都看得见。全世界。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，嗯，整条街都看得见呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "不是，是全世界。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——那可厉害了。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "呼。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "这里，是谁的东西吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "诶啊……可能说了随便的话。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这里是……公园吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "嗯——……不是，是更『这里』的那种。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这片土地的话，大概是自治体，或者国家吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "怎么说呢，不是那种……世界？",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "这里。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——哈哈，好难啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "说是世界的话，也不属于谁吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "谢谢，总觉得说不清楚。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "只是觉得，如果不是谁的东西就好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "这里。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……透？",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "总觉得，现在。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——星星，变多了呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊，真的。刚才那颗是哪个，已经分不清了。",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "诶——你找找看啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，已经很难了。",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "能的能的。",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶——那透你知道？",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "诶，嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "48"
      },
      "48": {
        "id": "48",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……不知道。",
        "nextNodeId": "49"
      },
      "49": {
        "id": "49",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "呼。",
        "nextNodeId": "50"
      },
      "50": {
        "id": "50",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——那，这个也加上。",
        "nextNodeId": "51"
      },
      "51": {
        "id": "51",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "52"
      },
      "52": {
        "id": "52",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "不是有『一生中想做的十件事』吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "53"
      },
      "53": {
        "id": "53",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "找到刚才那颗星。",
        "nextNodeId": "54"
      },
      "54": {
        "id": "54",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——那……哈哈，要到什么时候啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "55"
      },
      "55": {
        "id": "55",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "总有一天。",
        "nextNodeId": "56"
      },
      "56": {
        "id": "56",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "但是，能找到的。",
        "nextNodeId": "57"
      },
      "57": {
        "id": "57",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "如果不是谁的东西的话——"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
